        <mxCell id="legend-3" value="bold red = primary trade history table — feeds Tracker UI, Bot dashboard, daily P&amp;L roll-up.&#10;All user-scoped FKs ON DELETE CASCADE.&#10;Yellow tables are non-user (system / shared market data)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="1">
